# AI coding agents, as they appear in a commit's attribution.
#
# Shared by no-ai-coauthor-trailer (matches Co-authored-by: trailers) and
# no-ai-commit-identity (matches the commit's author and committer). Both feed
# the same shape — "Name <email>" — so one list covers both.
#
# One case-insensitive extended regular expression (ERE) per line. Blank lines
# and # comments are ignored. ^name anchors to the start of the name; a bare
# email matches anywhere in the string.
#
# To cover a new agent, add its name pattern and the address it commits as. Use
# ([^[:alnum:]]|$) rather than \b after a name: BSD grep (macOS) does not
# support \b.
#
# Deliberately NOT a blanket ban on Co-authored-by: — human co-author trailers
# are valid and used in this org's history.

# Anthropic / Claude Code
^claude([^[:alnum:]]|$)
noreply@anthropic\.com

# Cursor
^cursor([^[:alnum:]]|$)
cursoragent@cursor\.com

# Sculptor (Imbue)
^sculptor([^[:alnum:]]|$)
